# Staged at build time from build.rs (wb-i38o.16). The canonical
# sources live in:
#   packages/workbooks/spikes/oql-container/src/build.mjs
#   packages/workbooks/spikes/oql-container/package.json
#   packages/oql/crates/oql-wasm/pkg/      (wasm-pack --target nodejs)
#   packages/oql/crates/oql-wasm/pkg-web/  (wasm-pack --target web)
#
# We ignore the staged copies so the working tree never drifts from
# the monorepo originals — `cargo build` (via build.rs) keeps them
# in sync.
workbook-bundler/
oql-wasm/
oql-wasm-web/
node_modules/
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
